# Apple signing / APNs key material — NEVER commit.
# An APNs Auth Key (.p8) is downloadable from Apple exactly ONCE, never
# expires, and authenticates push for every app under the team. Keep it
# outside this repository entirely.
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
AuthKey_*
